ttps://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_792820719851503_7235324777230804935_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SmZ23fHqRmkQ7kNvwHOyGqk&_nc_oc=AdrsKeeY_wylROl6RZhV3WjzyrqznnqvOwTVetxPNUUp1ZDy41Z70ToGg238x-ofQ90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK6tY0GJ4oDCX02M-NFyiTYXMqNCBw6ATQOW-AXpSI8TA&oe=6ABBD4DF"}, "display_name": "Stellar Cafe", "keywords": ["Voice", "hands", "conversation", "ai", "llm"], "long_description": "The first VR game built entirely around your voice. No menus, no controllers, just real-time conversations and interactions.\n\nWelcome to Stellar Cafe, a coffee shop at the edge of the galaxy filled with quirky robots with bizarre ambitions and a lot to say. Pull up a seat, order whatever you can imagine, and meet a rotating cast of unforgettable characters. You might end up helping a robot quit their job, be a guest on their podcast, or chase their dreams. Your voice steers the story.\n\n# Voice-First Gameplay\n\nSpeak to the robots and they speak back. No dialog trees, just direct understanding and interaction all in real-time. Be creative and expressive, conversations are fully dynamic and driven by your voice!\n\n# Hand Tracking\n\nUse your hands, you want to grab it, do it! Reach, grab, sip, point and toss objects in your environment just like real-life. From adding creamer to your coffee to flinging a bottle of hot sauce at a robot, let both your hands and your voice do the talking.\n\n# Colorful Cast of Characters\n\nEvery robot has a unique personality, goals, and quirks.  Make a friend (or not) and uncover their stories.\n\nHumor\nExperience a new brand of humor where your voice helps drive the comedy.*\n\n\n*Performance and outcomes are subject to variability based on the individual. We are not liable for the lack of humor generated by the human. Side effects may include eye rolls, snorts, or the occasional \"that was clever\"\n", "short_description": "The first VR game built entirely around your voice. No menus, no controllers, just real-time conversations and interactions.\n\nWelcome to Stellar Cafe, a coffee shop at the edge of the galaxy, filled with quirky robots with bizarre ambitions and a lot to say. Pull up a seat, order whatever you can imagine, and meet a rotating cast of unforgettable characters. You might end up helping a robot quit their job, chase their dreams, or be a guest on their podcast. Your voice steers the story."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.astrobeam.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AstroBeam", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://astrobeam.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24043426531992999"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1757660088816073"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "847234511614170"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1757660088816073"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1789401360, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1757660088816073"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28172094912459453", "version": "10109"}, "id": "1828372331417926", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23951924494476537", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28172094912459453"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1828372331417926"}]}, "change_log": "Improved connection failure message\nSmall big fixes", "created_date": 1789688284, "id": "28172094912459453", "version": "10109", "version_code": 142, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23951924494476537", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28172094912459453"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789683982, "id": "28171576675844610", "version": "10109", "version_code": 141, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23951924494476537", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28172094912459453"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789683114, "id": "28171474162521528", "version": "10109", "version_code": 140, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23951924494476537", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28172094912459453"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1828372331417926"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed bug with very cold drink orders.", "created_date": 1784579302, "id": "27432734769728808", "version": "10080", "version_code": 138, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "23951924494476537", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28172094912459453"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1828372331417926"}]}, "change_log": "Faster response times - NPCs response even faster than before for a more real-time experience\n\nUpdated LLM and Text-to-Speech models\n\nReworked all LLM prompts to work better with newer models\n\nImproved safety model support\n\nJames now won't make a drink until he has your name and offers a standard drink if you don't want a custom one\n\nJames on Cycle 3 updates the menu and makes your drink in one step instead\n\nFixed bug where James would sometimes try to look at robots not in cafe\n\nSarah keeps responses short while adjusting her head position, won't ask your name in repair mode, and replies more naturally\n\nCarter won't force a second question if you already asked one and provides clearer \"studying is over\" signal\n\nCarter\u2019s study meter no longer fills too early\n\nToby\u2019s buyers now have unique personalities that flavor their reviews\n\nToby better understands if he is on the last item in the buyer list\n\nDebbie confirms your script submission and follows up with the next question correctly\n\nCindy will now ask you to be on the podcast only once\n\nKim wraps up only after the final prediction more reliably\n\nTed's email reply is now more specific to the email you sent\n\nPoly chimes at a better cadence and is funnier\n\nRobots will eventually ask you for help directly\n\nRobots now only discuss the planets after you bring them up\n\nFixed robots looking from their actual eye position\n\nVISOR now won't let you teleport to cafe tables until James places a drink in front of you\n\nVISOR now knows it's in the transport pod with you and no longer auto-teleports you to the counter\n\nFixed a bug where bringing up VISOR didn't always pause the currently-speaking robot\n\nFixed memories sometimes breaking on load\n\nVarious performance, lighting, and visual fixes", "created_date": 1782494311, "id": "27171485405853747", "version": "10065", "version_code": 137, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}